- $SET_TRUE_LABEL$ changes only the listed variables to true
- $SET_FALSE_LABEL$ changes only the listed variables to false
- List only variables whose values should change, not the complete assignment
- Separate multiple variable numbers with commas
- Use $NO_CHANGE$ when no variable is set to true or false
